  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Which of the following represents the Freundlich adsorption isotherms?</p><p>(A)</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9aa5b95b-f75c-4712-a66e-dcd31b99fd13.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 183px;\" /></p><p>(B)</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/24ac1e49-5643-4abe-b142-4f5ded2b57ca.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 163px;\" /></p><p>(C)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e91ae650-b239-48bd-839f-3f865b648eed.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 182px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(D)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/44c08baf-f178-4af5-a260-b5d91630faf7.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 197px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
